OL,3,GNEWSADrivers filmed passing too close
OL,4,Ato cycling police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlain-clothed police have taken to
OL,7,Ftheir bikes to film motorists who
OL,8,Fpassed too closely during overtakes.
OL,10,FThe officers filmed vehicles and
OL,11,Fflagged eight motorists for close-pass
OL,12,Fovertakes or overtaking at junctions in
OL,13,FLondon Road, Thetford.
OL,15,FThe drivers were then stopped by
OL,16,Funiformed officers as part of road
OL,17,Fsafety initiative Close Pass which also
OL,18,Faimed to show the risks of following
OL,19,Fcyclists too closely and also turning
OL,20,Fleft across their path.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
