OL,3,GNEWSADrivers filmed passing too close
OL,4,Ato cycling police
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Cyclists are among our most vulnerable
OL,7,Froad users and drivers have a
OL,8,Fresponsibility to give them sufficient
OL,9,Fspace when overtaking," said Insp James
OL,10,FShepherd of the Norfolk Roads and Armed
OL,11,FPolicing Team.
